    kfree(map->debugfs_name);
```
Reason:
The fix introduces a check to ensure that `map->debugfs_name` is only allocated if it has not been previously allocated, preventing the memory leak. Additionally, the `kfree` statement is now conditioned to only free `map->debugfs_name` if it is not NULL, ensuring that memory is properly managed and preventing double-free errors.

